// expect: 42
// AN AS-PATTERN COVERS WHAT ITS INNER PATTERN COVERS: `whole @ Leaf(_)`
// answers for `Leaf`, so the two arms are every variant of `Shape`, and the
// class refuses now, so a false "misses" would fail this fixture. Measured
// 2026-10-03 on boot 91257716: the exhaustiveness check read an as-pattern
// as covering nothing and reported the match (E_PatternInexhaustive: misses
// 1 of 2 variants); the class did not refuse yet, so the program ran to 42
// beside one false error.
type Shape = Leaf(Int) | Pair(Int, Int)

fn total(s) = match s {
  Pair(a, b) => a + b,
  whole @ Leaf(_) => match whole {
    Leaf(n) => n,
    Pair(_, _) => 0,
  },
}

fn main() = total(Leaf(40)) + total(Pair(1, 1))
